      "writtenOn": "2023-01-24T17:27:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\"Consume\" is weird verbiage if the DPM is just holding the Attention until the AP can grab it, particularly when \"consume\" is contrasted with \"pop.\" What about \"enqueue\" and \"dequeue\"? (I see that the helper function `vdm_enqueue_attention` already uses this verbiage.)",
